    {
      "id": "claim_ab578878dc1e4f4992ec2124b8670e32",
      "statement": "The trajectory smoothing lives in PfnnDirectionControlInput rather than being shared in PfnnStage, because a stage-level smoother would also lag PfnnSplineControlInput, whose deliberately open-loop path following is what the benchmark's path-following error measures.",
      "evidence": [
